<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's WestLB cuts prime rate to 25.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's WestLB cuts prime rate to 25.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Westdeutsche Landesbank (Hungaria) Rt reduced its prime lending rate on forint loans to 25.00 percent from 25.25 percent, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The reduction is effective September 26.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
